# INSPO — Tools & Services

## Current Stack (all free)

### Hosting & Deployment
- **Vercel** — Static site + serverless functions (free: 100GB bandwidth, 100K invocations/month)
  https://vercel.com

### AI Image Generation
- **Cloudflare Workers AI** — FLUX.1-schnell model (free: ~2,000 images/day, no credit card)
  https://cloudflare.com

### Email Delivery
- **Resend** — Transactional email API (free: 100 emails/day, 3,000/month)
  https://resend.com

### Fonts
- **Google Fonts** — Inter + Playfair Display (free, unlimited)
  https://fonts.google.com

### Source Control
- **GitHub** — Code hosting + version control (free)
  https://github.com

## Keys / Env Vars Needed
- `RESEND_API_KEY` — from https://resend.com (add in Vercel dashboard)
- `CF_API_TOKEN` — from https://cloudflare.com (Account → API Tokens)
- `CF_ACCOUNT_ID` — from Cloudflare dashboard sidebar
- `FROM_EMAIL` — (optional) defaults to `INSPO <onboarding@resend.dev>`

## Repository
- https://github.com/MH-787b/INSPO.git

